flowchart TD
  P[PICKUP opponent without own piece in hand] --> E[error_recovery_state: waiting_for_move_correction = true]
  E --> S[opponent_piece_* saved · invalid square cleared in board]
  S --> G[current_game_state = GAME_STATE_WAITING_FOR_RETURN]
  G --> B[red blink on original square · UART guidance]

  B --> D[DROP physically]
  D --> OK{to == opponent_original?}
  OK -->|yes| R[piece back on board · reset recovery · GAME_STATE_ACTIVE · highlight]
  OK -->|no| W[update opponent_current · keep waiting for correct square]

  R --> PLAY[continue game]

  G -.-> NTE[Note: during WAITING_FOR_RETURN + opponent_piece — DROP king must not cancel resignation timer — see in_opponent_return in DROP]
